      },
      "message": "feat!: take the ROS shim interfaces from ros-env (#711)\n\nThe stubs in `rclrs/src/vendor.rs` were added when the crate moved to\n`ros-env` for its messages, and in that same change every call site\nswitched from `crate::vendor::` to `ros_env::`. Nothing has referred to\nthem since. When building the with `use_ros_shim` it fails to resolve\n`ros_env::rcl_interfaces` at all.\n\nDrop the vendored stubs and let `ros-env` supply the interfaces under its own\n`use_ros_shim` feature, so the module paths are the same whether they\ncome from the shim or from a sourced workspace.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5 [Claude Code]",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "fe148f06aa23574fe539ce9ed6cae7a04897bb54",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2-rust/ros2_rust/git/trees/fe148f06aa23574fe539ce9ed6cae7a04897bb54"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ros2-rust/ros2_rust/git/commits/62154b385c44d1b039e91c63415a9261c84dc1d2",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
