        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqs78DCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYt8QAEQJfuVsuB9ELIfpejSjWF75\nvuotBP6PCLkYgYJsleB9A5gYX3L45VzJWwzoCK0vKbwtFKxSUNBL8BzDdQ5Jizn+\nBulMsbYxEJjxVEPl+YE6JhggXWFkatdiBuBpQbfd+pGr3WmjOkN1g5fL0n0FpQhQ\nzCiJ0lgcP8WWgCLCeZz9M+3L4qs2NJ9+nSn9WQ9IvBXoP3rtm19GYnRI51QsrtOU\n+TWf5bPBnixb7jjnx+sHxkGDzgQbYYq8qyxH59nzT5H618IWJn5U6HwU36zyBMPP\n3BrPNGSJd7dzbIPXoIh6rcvcpvyV6jGv1KR65Kof3Lj8ax2xpJHpjLhhR/fM9ohx\nGq9YrIB5ozuUWfWEWNGOTe9a9TW/0DIndIqIJQ9HCPI990O96sXAJbweQmFZVd/l\nVhjewZW6j+3t/gWwrAHTFkJhbtQfRtM00jm/0pI3N1Fud0fEsclwyH1hIaMS23FQ\nTJm8Or5p7BfcMhZcR3FNizPundHULuG2i0UDDBrcED33oC2H7m8tGIskaKmPGlDU\nait+44jVKiMW4YIkyVxsK9eQ5drKFy/iPambfp2apPzqSZh/vCNYfAE09p1x0pgR\nKhq9Qq1jJJf6Wdx8jpeGsQyKw/ySPdJ8iu+9XFPmz6WN0/s7UOB+RCANKaCA8YHX\nuDrqI766u4sqIX9YwHFh\n=aan5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree fe148f06aa23574fe539ce9ed6cae7a04897bb54\nparent d27a8cb9ccea23446c0e37fe56ba2623ade892af\nauthor Mathieu David <mathieudavid@mathieudavid.org> 1790164739 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790164739 +0200\n\nfeat!: take the ROS shim interfaces from ros-env (#711)\n\nThe stubs in `rclrs/src/vendor.rs` were added when the crate moved to\n`ros-env` for its messages, and in that same change every call site\nswitched from `crate::vendor::` to `ros_env::`. Nothing has referred to\nthem since. When building the with `use_ros_shim` it fails to resolve\n`ros_env::rcl_interfaces` at all.\n\nDrop the vendored stubs and let `ros-env` supply the interfaces under its own\n`use_ros_shim` feature, so the module paths are the same whether they\ncome from the shim or from a sourced workspace.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5 [Claude Code]",
